    <deftitle>BMW N20 320i MEVD17.2.9 E100 FlexFuel (ROM 017243)</deftitle>
    <description>Complete TunerPro XDF definition for BMW 320i ActiveFlex / Brazil E100 FlexFuel (MEVD17.2.9 / N20B20, ROM 9G4LFRX6, romVersion 017243). Contains all factory N20 maps PLUS all dedicated FlexFuel / Ethanol tables. VALID ONLY FOR romVersion 017243 / ROM 9G4LFRX6: table addresses do not transfer between ROM versions, so using this file against another ROM reads and writes the wrong locations. Verify a few known values before writing anything.</description>
    <BASEOFFSET offset="0" subtract="0" />
    <DEFAULTS datasizeinbits="16" sigdigits="1" outputtype="1" signed="0" lsbfirst="1" float="0" />
    <REGION type="0xFFFFFFFF" startaddress="0x0" size="0x400000" regionflags="0x0" name="Binary File" desc="This region describes the bin file edited by this XDF" />
