  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x0" flags="0x0">
    <title>Knock Detection Threshold Cylinder Group 1</title>
    <description>KFRKRMX1N
Modifies the maximum knock detection reference threshold. &lt;br&gt; Leave stock on pumpgas and stock engine, it is possible to increase slightly on higher octane such as 50 percent ethanol or higher. &lt;br&gt; On a built engine, some pistons can add more noise and have knock voltage rise a lot, it is possible to increase the values of this table, but only at good octane i.e. E30 or higher.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="8" />
    <CATEGORYMEM index="1" category="9" />
