  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0x0" flags="0x0">
    <title>Optimal Reference Torque 1</title>
    <description>KF_MDIOP_1
Modifies the optimal reference torque from filling and engine speed. &lt;br&gt; Scale up for upgraded turbos and high power applications. &lt;br&gt; Lowering torque values will result in higher load, but as a consequence will show lower torque to the system which may result in clutch slip.</description>
